###  https://w3id.org/aias#hasCommunication
<https://w3id.org/aias#hasCommunication> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                         rdfs:domain <https://w3id.org/aias#Component> ;
                                         rdfs:range <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Communication> ;
                                         rdfs:comment "Relates a component to a communication it takes part in. States a bidirectional use."@en ,
                                                      "Verbindet eine Komponente mit einer Kommunikation, an der sie teilnimmt. Definiert eine bidirektionale Nutzung."@de ;
                                         rdfs:label "has communication"@en ,
                                                    "hat Kommunikation"@de ;
                                         <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> """A communication describes the exchange of information between at least two resources, and an instance of it is tied to the components taking part, which makes the technical realisation of a data flow explicit.

The two relations below differentiate the direction. They are not subproperties of this one: a sensor that only sends carries hasOutputCommunication and nothing else, and a reasoner that inferred hasCommunication from it would report the sensor as bidirectional, which is the opposite of what the model states.

The domain is the component rather than the resource on purpose. A product may take part in a communication as well: a workpiece carrying an RFID tag or a barcode is read along the line, and restricting the relation to resources would rule that out."""@en .


###  https://w3id.org/aias#hasComponent
<https://w3id.org/aias#hasComponent> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                     rdfs:domain <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#AISystem> ;
                                     rdfs:range <https://w3id.org/aias#Component> ;
                                     rdfs:comment "Relates an AI system to a physical component it is built from."@en ,
                                                  "Verbindet ein KI-System mit einer physischen Komponente, aus der es aufgebaut ist."@de ;
                                     rdfs:label "has component"@en ,
                                                "hat Komponente"@de .


###  https://w3id.org/aias#hasFlow
<https://w3id.org/aias#hasFlow> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                rdfs:domain [ rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                              owl:unionOf ( <https://w3id.org/aias#Component>
                                                            <https://w3id.org/aias#Function>
                                                          )
                                            ] ;
                                rdfs:range <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#Flow> ;
                                rdfs:comment "Relates a function, a component or a product to a flow it takes part in."@en ,
                                             "Verbindet eine Funktion, eine Komponente oder ein Produkt mit einem Fluss, an dem sie teilnimmt."@de ;
                                rdfs:label "has flow"@en ,
                                           "hat Fluss"@de .


###  https://w3id.org/aias#hasFunction
<https://w3id.org/aias#hasFunction> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                    rdfs:domain <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#AISystem> ;
                                    rdfs:range <https://w3id.org/aias#Function> ;
                                    rdfs:comment "Relates an AI system to a function it carries out, whichever subdomain the function comes from."@en ,
                                                 "Verbindet ein KI-System mit einer Funktion, die es ausführt, aus welchem Teilbereich sie auch stammt."@de ;
                                    rdfs:label "has function"@en ,
                                               "hat Funktion"@de .


###  https://w3id.org/aias#hasInputCommunication
<https://w3id.org/aias#hasInputCommunication> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                              rdfs:domain <https://w3id.org/aias#Component> ;
                                              rdfs:range <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Communication> ;
                                              rdfs:comment "Beschreibt eine unidirektionale Nutzung als Empfänger."@de ,
                                                           "Describes a unidirectional use as a receiver."@en ;
                                              rdfs:label "has input communication"@en ,
                                                         "hat eingehende Kommunikation"@de .


###  https://w3id.org/aias#hasOutputCommunication
<https://w3id.org/aias#hasOutputCommunication> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                               rdfs:domain <https://w3id.org/aias#Component> ;
                                               rdfs:range <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Communication> ;
                                               rdfs:comment "Beschreibt eine unidirektionale Nutzung als Sender."@de ,
                                                            "Describes a unidirectional use as a sender."@en ;
                                               rdfs:label "has output communication"@en ,
                                                          "hat ausgehende Kommunikation"@de .


###  https://w3id.org/aias#hasRelation
<https://w3id.org/aias#hasRelation> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                    rdfs:domain <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#AISystem> ;
                                    rdfs:range <https://w3id.org/aias#Relation> ;
                                    rdfs:comment "Relates an AI system to a tie between its functions and its components."@en ,
                                                 "Verbindet ein KI-System mit einer Verbindung zwischen seinen Funktionen und Komponenten."@de ;
                                    rdfs:label "has relation"@en ,
                                               "hat Relation"@de .


###  https://w3id.org/aias#isAssignedTo
<https://w3id.org/aias#isAssignedTo> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                     rdfs:domain [ rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                   owl:unionOf ( <https://w3id.org/aias#Component>
                                                                 <https://w3id.org/aias#Function>
                                                               )
                                                 ] ;
                                     rdfs:range <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#Assignment> ;
                                     rdfs:comment "Relates a function or a component to the assignment stating which resource carries out which function."@en ,
                                                  "Verbindet eine Funktion oder eine Komponente mit der Zuordnung, die angibt, welche Ressource welche Funktion ausführt."@de ;
                                     rdfs:label "is assigned to"@en ,
                                                "ist zugeordnet"@de ;
                                     <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "VDI 3682 states the assignment from the process operator, which cannot reach a function of another subdomain. This relation is what closes that gap."@en .


#################################################################
#    Classes
#################################################################

###  https://w3id.org/aias#Actuator
<https://w3id.org/aias#Actuator> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                 rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/aias#Resource> ;
                                 rdfs:comment "Devices intervening physically in the technical process."@en ,
                                              "Geräte, die physisch in den technischen Prozess eingreifen."@de ;
                                 rdfs:label "Actuator"@en ,
                                            "Aktor"@de .


###  https://w3id.org/aias#Component
<https://w3id.org/aias#Component> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                  rdfs:comment "Beschreibt physische Systemelemente, die Funktionen ausführen oder durch sie umgewandelt werden."@de ,
                                               "Describes physical system elements that perform functions or are transformed by them."@en ;
                                  rdfs:label "Component"@en ,
                                             "Komponente"@de ;
                                  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> """A construct of this work, following the system elements of Haberfellner. It covers physical elements only.

Software artefacts such as models or AI components are deliberately not modelled as components. They stay in the AI subdomain, and their place in the whole is recorded through the functions they realise and the assignment of those functions to a resource."""@en .


###  https://w3id.org/aias#Computer
<https://w3id.org/aias#Computer> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                 rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/aias#Resource> ;
                                 rdfs:comment "Devices with fixed, higher computing capacity that can be extended by additional hardware."@en ,
                                              "Geräte mit fester, höherer Rechenleistung, die durch zusätzliche Hardware erweiterbar sind."@de ;
                                 rdfs:label "Computer"@en ,
                                            "Rechner"@de .


###  https://w3id.org/aias#Controller
<https://w3id.org/aias#Controller> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                   rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/aias#Resource> ;
                                   rdfs:comment "Devices for the deterministic and time-critical processing of signals in order to control the automated system or process."@en ,
                                                "Geräte zur deterministischen und echtzeitkritischen Verarbeitung von Signalen zur Steuerung und Regelung des automatisierten Systems beziehungsweise Prozesses."@de ;
                                   rdfs:label "Controller"@en ,
                                              "Steuerung"@de .


###  https://w3id.org/aias#EdgeDevice
<https://w3id.org/aias#EdgeDevice> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                   rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/aias#Resource> ;
                                   rdfs:comment "Microcontrollers or compact industrial computers with limited computing capacity available locally in the plant network or the company network."@en ,
                                                "Mikrocontroller oder kompakte Industriecomputer mit begrenzter, lokal verfügbarer Rechenleistung im Anlagennetzwerk oder Unternehmensnetzwerk."@de ;
                                   rdfs:label "Edge Device"@en ,
                                              "Edge-Gerät"@de .


###  https://w3id.org/aias#ExternalCloud
<https://w3id.org/aias#ExternalCloud> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                      rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/aias#Resource> ;
                                      rdfs:comment "Flexibel skalierbare Rechenressourcen außerhalb des Anlagen- oder Unternehmensnetzes, deren Zugriff typischerweise ein externes Netzwerk, etwa eine Internetverbindung, erfordert."@de ,
                                                   "Flexibly scalable computing resources outside the plant or company network, reaching which typically requires an external network such as an internet connection."@en ;
                                      rdfs:label "External Cloud"@en ,
                                                 "Externe Cloud"@de ;
                                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "A function running here leaves the organisation, which is what separates it from the internal cloud."@en .


###  https://w3id.org/aias#Function
<https://w3id.org/aias#Function> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                 rdfs:comment "Beschreibt Transformationen, durch die Eingaben in Ausgaben überführt werden, um Systemziele zu erreichen."@de ,
                                              "Describes transformations by which inputs are turned into outputs in order to reach the objectives of a system."@en ;
                                 rdfs:label "Function"@en ,
                                            "Funktion"@de ;
                                 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> """A construct of this work, following the system elements of Haberfellner et al., Systems Engineering, Springer 2019. The notion of a function is the general one of a purposeful transformation.

Without this class a process operator of VDI 3682 and an inference of ISO/IEC 22989 are unrelated things, and nothing can be said about both at once. Under one superclass they become comparable and are treated by the same mechanisms, above all the assignment to a component."""@en .


###  https://w3id.org/aias#InternalCloud
<https://w3id.org/aias#InternalCloud> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                      rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/aias#Resource> ;
                                      rdfs:comment "Flexibel skalierbare Rechenressourcen innerhalb des Anlagen- oder Unternehmensnetzes."@de ,
                                                   "Flexibly scalable computing resources inside the plant or company network."@en ;
                                      rdfs:label "Internal Cloud"@en ,
                                                 "Interne Cloud"@de .


###  https://w3id.org/aias#Product
<https://w3id.org/aias#Product> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                owl:equivalentClass <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#Product> ;
                                rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/aias#Component> ;
                                rdfs:comment "Physical objects created, changed or consumed in the course of a technical process."@en ,
                                             "Physische Objekte, die im Verlauf eines technischen Prozesses erzeugt, verändert oder verbraucht werden."@de ;
                                rdfs:label "Product"@en ,
                                           "Produkt"@de ;
                                <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> """A construct of this work, corresponding to the product of VDI 3682.

Products and resources share the component level and differ in their role: a resource performs functions, a product is transformed by them."""@en .


###  https://w3id.org/aias#Relation
<https://w3id.org/aias#Relation> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                 rdfs:comment "Beschreibt strukturierte Beziehungen und Abhängigkeiten zwischen Funktionen und Komponenten."@de ,
                                              "Describes structured relationships and dependencies between functions and components."@en ;
                                 rdfs:label "Relation"@de ,
                                            "Relation"@en ;
                                 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> """A construct of this work, following the system elements of Haberfellner.

Three specialisations concretise it, each taken from a subdomain pattern: the assignment and the flow of VDI 3682, and the communication of ISO/IEC 7498-1. Relations are classes rather than object properties so that a model can annotate one: an assignment is a thing, not an arrow."""@en .


###  https://w3id.org/aias#Resource
<https://w3id.org/aias#Resource> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                 owl:equivalentClass <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#TechnicalResource> ;
                                 rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/aias#Component> ;
                                 rdfs:comment "A physical component performing a function."@en ,
                                              "Physische Komponente, die eine Funktion ausführt."@de ;
                                 rdfs:label "Resource"@en ,
                                            "Ressource"@de ;
                                 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> """A construct of this work, equated with the technical resource of VDI 3682: a resource is what performs a function, which is what that standard defines the technical resource as.

The kinds of resource below are the devices of a plant. They come from no standard and can be refined further through a classification of equipment such as ECLASS."""@en .


###  https://w3id.org/aias#Sensor
<https://w3id.org/aias#Sensor> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                               rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/aias#Resource> ;
                               rdfs:comment "Devices acquiring measured values from the technical process and digitising them."@en ,
                                            "Geräte, die Messwerte aus dem technischen Prozess erfassen und digitalisieren."@de ;
                               rdfs:label "Sensor"@de ,
                                          "Sensor"@en ;
                               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "A construct of this work. None of the seven device classes rests on a standard."@en .


###  https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#AIFunction
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#AIFunction> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/aias#Function> .


###  https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#AISystem
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#AISystem> rdf:type owl:Class .


###  https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Communication
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Communication> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                  rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/aias#Relation> .


###  https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#Assignment
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#Assignment> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                               rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/aias#Relation> .


###  https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#Flow
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#Flow> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                         rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/aias#Relation> .


###  https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#ProcessOperator
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#ProcessOperator> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                    rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/aias#Function> .


###  https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#Product
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#Product> rdf:type owl:Class .


###  https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#TechnicalResource
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#TechnicalResource> rdf:type owl:Class .


